title: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › Edit, sign and file
route: /denials?id=D-3318
intro: With the letter drafted, the person edits it, picks the evidence, saves a draft, and a licensed clinician signs. Navigator files only after the signature.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: Navigator's filing through the payer's portal is simulated (about one second).
---
start s1 "The appeal drawer is open with the drafted letter"
input i1 "Edit the letter text\n(box 'Appeal letter')"
input i2 "Tick or untick items under 'Evidence to attach'"
click c1 "Click 'Save draft'"
store st1 "Letter and evidence saved on the denial\nStatus does not change"
toast t1 "'Draft saved'\n'It stays in Denial Intelligence until a clinician signs.'"

click c2 "Click 'Sign and file'"
overlay o1 "Modal 'Sign and file the appeal'\n'Sign-off gate. A licensed clinician signs every appeal.'"
input i3 "'Signing as' (required)\nMedical director (chosen at first), Clinical director, Treating clinician (licensed)"
input i4 "Tick: 'I reviewed this letter against the chart. Every statement is accurate and supported by the evidence attached.'"
decision d1 "Is the box ticked?"
process p1 "'Sign and file' stays greyed out"
click c3 "Click 'Sign and file' in the modal"
wait w1 "Button reads 'Navigator is filing' for about a second\n'Cancel' and Esc do nothing meanwhile"

store st2 "Appeal filed: letter, evidence, who signed, time, decision date\nHistory: 'You signed the appeal as Medical director' with 'Attested that the letter was reviewed against the chart.'"
ext x1 "Payer's portal takes the appeal (demo: simulated)"
agent a1 "Navigator files it through the payer's portal and saves the receipt"
store st3 "Request: chip 'Appeal filed' ('Second-level appeal filed' or 'External review' on a later level), 'Waiting on the payer'\nDeadline cleared; 'filed 10/20', 'decision 11/19'"
toast t2 "'Appeal filed'\n'Cardinal decides by 11/19. It shows on the Dashboard.'"
toast t3 "Notification 'Appeal filed' from Navigator\nOpens the request on the Dashboard"
process p2 "Drawer closes\nBanner 'Appeal filed. Waiting on the payer'\n'Your options' card is gone"

click c4 "Click 'Cancel' or the X in the modal"
process p3 "Back to the open drawer, nothing filed"
click c5 "Press Esc while the modal is open"
process p4 "Only the modal closes (one layer per press)\nThe drawer stays open and the letter keeps its unsaved edits"
click c6 "Press Esc again, or click X in the drawer"
endx e1 "Drawer closes\nEdits since the last 'Save draft' are lost"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › After filing"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"

s1 --> i1 --> c1
s1 --> i2 --> c1
c1 --> st1 --> t1
s1 --> c2 --> o1
o1 --> i3 --> d1
o1 --> i4 --> d1
d1 -->|No| p1
d1 -->|Yes| c3 --> w1 --> st2
st2 --> x1 --> a1 --> st3 --> t2 --> p2
st3 --> t3 --> g2
p2 --> g1
o1 --> c4 --> p3
o1 --> c5 --> p4 --> c6 --> e1
p3 --> c6
